msgid "Enable AI Crawler Blocker (robots.txt Rules)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:735
msgid "Off (Intentional)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:736
msgid "Injects clean User-agent Disallow: / sections into your live /robots.txt (includes a live preview panel inside the plugin). Polite crawlers obey immediately."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:737
msgid "Do NOT enable blindly on affiliate blogs, SaaS marketing pages, local businesses, or WooCommerce shops that want ChatGPT/Perplexity buyers to find and cite their brand."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:740
msgid "Block via User-Agent Header (403 Response)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:743
msgid "Actively checks HTTP User-Agent on every frontend request and terminates matching bots with HTTP 403 Forbidden—stopping rogue scrapers that ignore robots.txt."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:744
msgid "Avoid turning on unless aggressive AI scrapers are spiking your CPU/bandwidth—some legitimate social preview fetchers share generic tokens if misconfigured."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:747
