msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:750
msgid "Individually check/uncheck 21 major AI bots or use Select All/Deselect All. Pro adds Custom User-Agent Strings (one case-insensitive substring per line when UA 403 blocking is active)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:751
msgid "NEVER enter short or common browser substrings (like \"Mozilla\", \"Chrome\", \"Safari\", or \"Bot\") into Custom User-Agents—substring matching would block real human visitors and Googlebot!"
msgstr ""

