msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:811
msgid "WPEPP Security → Logs & Tools"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:813
msgid "Real-time server diagnostics & performance suite (Overview, Slow Queries, Cron Jobs, Error Log, Plugin Performance, Options Bloat), dedicated Login Activity Log, and full WP-CLI terminal automation."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:817
msgid "Always Turn OFF \"SAVEQUERIES\" After Debugging!"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:818
msgid "Enabling Query Logging (SAVEQUERIES) inside CPU Monitor → Slow Queries records every SQL query + stack trace in RAM during every request. Leaving it turned on in live production significantly increases PHP memory usage and slows down your store."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:822
msgid "Use CPU Monitor → Overview to check CPU %, PHP Memory limit/peak, load average, and health status."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:823
msgid "Inspect Options Bloat and run Clean Expired Transients whenever wp_options autoload size grows sluggish."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:824
msgid "During slow-site debugging, temporarily switch SAVEQUERIES or WP_DEBUG_LOG on, inspect findings, then switch both back OFF."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:828
msgid "Overview & Slow Queries (SAVEQUERIES Toggle)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:830
msgid "SAVEQUERIES Off"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:831
msgid "Shows live CPU/RAM metrics and slow SQL queries (Free shows last 10 queries; Pro reveals full PHP call stacks to pinpoint which plugin triggered slow SQL). One-click SAVEQUERIES wp-config toggle included."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:832
msgid "NEVER forget to toggle SAVEQUERIES back OFF after troubleshooting! Also requires writable wp-config.php."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:835
msgid "WP-Cron Events & Options Bloat (Clean Expired Transients)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:837
msgid "Read-Only Free / Actions Pro"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:838
msgid "Lists scheduled WP-Cron hooks (Pro lets you Run Now or Delete orphaned hooks) and displays wp_options table size & autoload size with a free 1-click Clean Expired Transients button."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:839
msgid "NEVER delete built-in WordPress cron hooks (wp_version_check, wp_privacy_delete_old_export_files, WooCommerce subscription/webhook jobs) unless you know a hook belongs to an uninstalled plugin."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:842
msgid "Error Log & Plugin Performance Footprint"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:844
msgid "Debug Off"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:845
