msgid "Settings, DB Maintenance & Backups"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:870
msgid "WPEPP Security → Settings"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:872
msgid "Global plugin configuration, password cookie expiration, uninstall cleanup policy, live database footprint diagnostics with automated pruning, JSON backup/restore, and sitewide Custom CSS."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:874
msgid "Set Password Cookie Expiration (1–365 days, default 10) for password-protected posts under Settings → General."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:875
msgid "Check Settings → Database & Logs monthly (or enable Pro Automatic Daily Pruning) to keep log tables lean."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:876
msgid "Download a JSON Backup from Settings → Backup & Restore before making major firewall/server changes or migrating sites."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:880
msgid "Password Cookie Expiration & Delete Data on Uninstall"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:882
msgid "10 Days / Delete Off"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:883
msgid "Controls how many days unlocked post passwords stay valid in a visitor's browser cookie (1–365). Turn ON Delete Data on Uninstall only when permanently removing WPEPP and wanting zero leftover tables or options."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:884
msgid "NEVER enable Delete Data on Uninstall if you are only deactivating the plugin temporarily to troubleshoot—it wipes all saved settings, blocks, and form designs when deleted."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:887
msgid "Database & Log Maintenance (Auto Pruning & Max Rows Cap)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:889
msgid "30d/7d / 5,000 Rows Cap"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:890
msgid "Shows exact row counts and KB/MB footprint across Events, Logins, Slow Queries, and Blocks tables, with a Free \"Clean Old Logs Now\" button. Pro enables Automatic Daily Pruning, custom retention windows (7–90d events/logins, 3–30d queries), and Flood Protection cap (1,000–10,000 rows)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:891
msgid "Avoid setting 90 days + 10,000 rows on small shared MySQL plans with high bot traffic—30 days & 5,000 rows keeps dashboards snappy."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:894
msgid "Backup & Restore (JSON Export / Import)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:897
