msgstr ""

#: includes/class-docs.php:898
msgid "Note that API secrets (reCAPTCHA & Turnstile Secret Keys) are intentionally omitted from JSON exports for security—always re-enter your Secret Keys manually after importing on a new site."
msgstr ""

